# 🚀 Naukri Company Site Scanner

A Chrome Extension that extracts **company career page URLs** from Naukri job listings, tracks applied jobs, caches scan results, and exports pending jobs to CSV.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🔍 Scan Naukri search result pages
- 🌐 Extract official company career websites
- 💾 Cache scan results to avoid duplicate work
- 📋 Track applied jobs
- 📤 Export pending jobs to CSV
- 🔄 Force rescan when cache expires
- 🗑️ Clear cached data
- 📊 Live scan statistics

---

# Architecture

```text
                   +----------------------+
                   |      popup.html      |
                   |  (Extension UI)      |
                   +----------+-----------+
                              |
                              |
                              v
                   +----------------------+
                   |      popup.js        |
                   |  User Interactions   |
                   +----------+-----------+
                              |
              chrome.runtime.sendMessage()
                              |
                              v
          +-----------------------------------+
          |       background.js               |
          | (Service Worker / Controller)     |
          +-----------------------------------+
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             |            |            |
             v            v            v
   +----------------+ +----------------+ +----------------+
   | Chrome Storage | | Active Tab     | | Downloads API  |
   | Cache / Stats  | | Content Script | | Export CSV     |
   +-------+--------+ +--------+-------+ +----------------+
           |                  |
           |                  |
           |                  |
           |                  v
           |        +------------------------+
           |        |      script.js         |
           |        | Injected into Naukri   |
           |        | Waits for Company Site |
           |        | Extracts URLs          |
           |        +-----------+------------+
           |                    |
           |                    |
           +--------------------+
                    Stores Cache
```

