---

# Component Responsibilities

## popup.js

Responsible for the extension UI.

Features:

- Start Scan
- Download CSV
- Clear Cache
- Force Scan
- Refresh statistics
- Communicate with Background Service Worker

---

## background.js

Acts as the central controller.

Responsibilities:

- Handle all extension messages
- Maintain cache
- Store scan history
- Maintain applied jobs
- Download CSV files
- Coordinate communication between popup and content scripts

---

## script.js

Runs inside the active Naukri tab.

Responsibilities:

- Wait for company site button
- Extract company career URL
- Detect job IDs
- Send extracted data back to background.js

---

## Chrome Storage

Used for:

- Cached company URLs
- Applied jobs
- Last scan timestamp
- Statistics

This avoids rescanning already processed jobs.

---

## Downloads API

Creates downloadable CSV files containing:

- Job Title
- Company Name
- Career URL
- Status
- Applied Date

---

# Scan Flow

```text
User clicks Scan
        │
        ▼
popup.js
        │
        ▼
background.js
        │
        ▼
Inject script.js
        │
        ▼
Open each job
        │
        ▼
Extract Company URL
        │
        ▼
Store in Cache
        │
        ▼
Repeat
        │
        ▼
Update UI
```

---

# Cache Flow

```text
Job Requested
      │
      ▼
Is Job in Cache?
      │
 ┌────┴─────┐
 │          │
Yes         No
 │          │
 │          ▼
 │     Scan Page
 │          │
 │          ▼
 │     Save Cache
 │          │
 └──────►Return Result
```

---

# Export Flow

```text
Download CSV
      │
      ▼
Load Cached Jobs
      │
      ▼
Load Applied Jobs
      │
      ▼
Filter Pending Jobs
      │
      ▼
Generate CSV
      │
      ▼
Chrome Downloads API
```

